# Title: Suspicious Processes Spawned by WinRM
# ID: 5cc2cda8-f261-4d88-a2de-e9e193c86716
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Andreas Hunkeler (@Karneades), Markus Neis
# Date: 2021-05-20
# Tags: attack.t1190, attack.initial-access, attack.persistence, attack.privilege-escalation
# Description: Detects suspicious processes including shells spawnd from WinRM host process
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(parent_name:*\\wsmprovhost.exe AND (process_name:*\\cmd.exe OR process_name:*\\sh.exe OR process_name:*\\bash.exe OR process_name:*\\powershell.exe OR process_name:*\\pwsh.exe OR process_name:*\\wsl.exe OR process_name:*\\schtasks.exe OR process_name:*\\certutil.exe OR process_name:*\\whoami.exe OR process_name:*\\bitsadmin.exe))
